{"id":"n30311-1-11","stage":2,"title":"부러워하다 · 羡慕","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n30311-1-11-1","ko":"민준이는 이번 시험에서도 일 등을 했대. 정말 부럽다.","zh":"听说敏俊这次考试又得了第一名。真让人羡慕啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"민준이는","meaning":"敏俊","explanation":"민준：敏俊；이：名词后缀，构成派生名词；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"민준이는","audio":"/audio/068c382ba3282b86786d.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"민준이는","audio":"/audio/068c382ba3282b86786d.mp3"}},{"text":"이번","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回。","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}},{"text":"시험에서도","meaning":"考试","explanation":"시험：考试；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"시험","audio":"/audio/ff65dc582ce71198934b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20233","senseId":"1","lemma":"시험","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시험에서도","audio":"/audio/d217fc8e39444af3f2d6.mp3"}},{"text":"일","meaning":"第一","explanation":"일：第一。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31528","senseId":"2","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}},{"text":"등을","meaning":"第……名","explanation":"등：第……名；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"등","audio":"/audio/ad8c9dea07d94cabd325.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49990","senseId":"1","lemma":"등","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"등을","audio":"/audio/b9eb89cb2f2242dbae05.mp3"}},{"text":"했대.","meaning":"获得，取得","explanation":"하다：获得，取得；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；대：口语中转述听来的话，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"8","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"했대","audio":"/audio/4f4efca17218bfeb6521.mp3"}},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的。","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61174","senseId":"1","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}},{"text":"부럽다.","meaning":"羡慕，眼馋","explanation":"부럽다：羡慕，眼馋；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"부럽다","audio":"/audio/f08bb8a4d146896824a8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59509","senseId":"1","lemma":"부럽다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"부럽다","audio":"/audio/f08bb8a4d146896824a8.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"da78d4146f0588e8","term":"이번","zh":"这次，这回","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3","entryId":"29737","definition":"马上到来的顺序；或指刚过去的顺序。","pronunciation":["이번"]},{"id":"ff65dc582ce71198","term":"시험","zh":"考试","audio":"/audio/ff65dc582ce71198934b.mp3","entryId":"20233","definition":"按照问题、提问、实际行动等一定程序考核考生的知识或能力的事宜。","pronunciation":["시험"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"第一","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"31528","definition":"第一次的。","pronunciation":["일"]},{"id":"ad8c9dea07d94cab","term":"등","zh":"第……名","audio":"/audio/ad8c9dea07d94cabd325.mp3","entryId":"49990","definition":"表示等级或名次的单位。","pronunciation":["등ː"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"获得，取得","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"实现某种结果。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61174","definition":"没有虚假而真正地。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"f08bb8a4d1468968","term":"부럽다","zh":"羡慕，眼馋","audio":"/audio/f08bb8a4d146896824a8.mp3","entryId":"59509","definition":"别人的事情或东西看起来很好时心里希望自己也能够做成那件事或得到那个东西。","pronunciation":["부럽따"]}],"audio":"/audio/7de0bb2cd173658f6445.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n30311-1-11-2","ko":"너무 부러워하지 마. 너도 성적이 많이 올랐잖아.","zh":"别太羡慕了。你的成绩也提高了不少啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太。","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}},{"text":"부러워하지","meaning":"羡慕","explanation":"부러워하다：羡慕；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"부러워하다","audio":"/audio/50382150015cb0c69394.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30311","senseId":"1","lemma":"부러워하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"부러워하지","audio":"/audio/742621ba17064536d42f.mp3"}},{"text":"마.","meaning":"不要做、停止做（-지 말다）","explanation":"말다：不要做、停止做（-지 말다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"말다","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69296","senseId":"2","lemma":"말다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"마","audio":"/audio/0a8a81fee098641dbae5.mp3"}},{"text":"너도","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너도","audio":"/audio/31b5ecd28525b86681fe.mp3"}},{"text":"성적이","meaning":"成绩","explanation":"성적：成绩；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"성적","audio":"/audio/cc5bf6a36796ed18e880.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64457","senseId":"2","lemma":"성적","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"성적이","audio":"/audio/234b1582309443aa42ff.mp3"}},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多。","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}},{"text":"올랐잖아.","meaning":"上升，上涨","explanation":"오르다：上升，上涨；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；잖아：提醒对方已知的事实，非敬语：“不是……嘛”。","readings":[{"term":"오르다","audio":"/audio/8fdeb9822b3fa0617051.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69518","senseId":"10","lemma":"오르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"올랐잖아","audio":"/audio/fee6465d433a5cec9075.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"50382150015cb0c6","term":"부러워하다","zh":"羡慕","audio":"/audio/50382150015cb0c69394.mp3","entryId":"30311","definition":"看到某物想要拥有或看到某人想要成为像他那样的人。","pronunciation":["부러워하다"]},{"id":"f8b54c8d9bfb2043","term":"말다","zh":"不要做、停止做（-지 말다）","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3","entryId":"69296","definition":"不要做、停止做（-지 말다）","pronunciation":["말ː다"]},{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"cc5bf6a36796ed18","term":"성적","zh":"成绩","audio":"/audio/cc5bf6a36796ed18e880.mp3","entryId":"64457","definition":"通过考试对学生的学习进行评价的结果。","pronunciation":["성적"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"8fdeb9822b3fa061","term":"오르다","zh":"上升，上涨","audio":"/audio/8fdeb9822b3fa0617051.mp3","entryId":"69518","definition":"价格、数值、温度、成绩等比以前多或高。","pronunciation":["오르다"]}],"audio":"/audio/248802667579609bf6e1.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.459,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=30311","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":83,"sequenceScore":2.2857,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["听说敏俊这次考试又得了第一名。真让人羡慕啊。","别太羡慕了。你的成绩也提高了不少啊。","您平时经常喝酒吗？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["听说敏俊这次考试又得了第一名。真让人羡慕啊。","别太羡慕了。你的成绩也提高了不少啊。","您平时经常喝酒吗？"],"answer":1}]}
